herdr/patches/*.patch modify the `tabs` and `menu` mods that ship with
herdr-app (https://herdr.dev), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The patches contain
context lines from those files. `install` applies them to the copies of those mods found on the
user's machine and writes the results as orc-tabs and orc-menu.
Changes made: the project tab has no close button (tabs), and a project space's menu offers
"Close project…" (menu).
